   "title": "Tailored for this setup",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Upscale, FLUX 3 Klein (creative)**\n\nEnlarges the image, then Klein repaints it lightly while also *looking at the original* (as `<ref_image_0>`), so layout and identity hold while new detail appears.\n\n- **denoise** (KSampler): 0.25 subtle, **0.35 default**, 0.45-0.5 strong (starts to change things).\n- **megapixels**: 4 = about 2x of a 1 MP image. Up to ~6 is fine on 12 GB; for more, run SeedVR2 on the result.\n- **Prompt**: name the detail you want (\"visible skin pores, sharp fabric weave\").\n- Same seed + lower denoise = safer. Output: `output/upscale/`"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
